<p>Beef   unavail  unavail    59,798 : 34,687   59,798  - 42.0%</p>
<p>Pork   unavail  unavail    37,330 : 20,734   37,330  - 44.5%</p>
<p>*Year to date totals may reflect revisions from previous weeks Source: Agriculture Canada.</p>
